---
<section class="section cta" id="reservar">
  <div class="wrap cta-inner">
    <div class="cta-content">
      <h2 class="cta-title">Cusco Solo Necesita una Cosa:<br />Que Tú Digas Sí</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">
        Cupos limitados por fecha. Consulta disponibilidad ahora — es gratis,<br />toma menos de 2 minutos y no te compromete a nada.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-action-wrap">
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-cta-yellow">
          Quiero Mi Lugar en Cusco <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-pills">
        <span class="pill">Precio desde $899 USD por persona</span>
        <span class="pill">Todo incluido</span>
        <span class="pill">Pago en USD</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: clamp(100px, 14vw, 160px);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5, 46, 22, 0.92) 0%, rgba(2, 44, 34, 0.98) 100%),
      url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589556264800-03c0ca61864b?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.8vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cta-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-bottom: 38px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-action-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .btn-cta-yellow {
    background: #FBBF24;
    color: #141210;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .btn-cta-yellow:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.6);
  }

  .cta-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .pill {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }
</style>
